    "expectedObservations": [
      "The launch-config scenario should surface a launch-configuration defect at the immediate-after-submission check; cudaPeekAtLastError should observe without clearing, and cudaGetLastError should retrieve and clear that same launch state before explicit synchronization.",
      "The deferred-access scenario should show no launch error at the immediate check and should surface the deliberately invalid device access only when cudaDeviceSynchronize establishes the completion boundary.",
      "The indexing-defect scenario should complete without an illegal memory access but fail deterministic host verification because its in-bounds column-major permutation disagrees with the declared row-major reference.",
      "The repaired-indexing scenario should complete explicit synchronization and match the overflow-checked row-major host reference."
